# Executive Dashboard Design

## Dashboard Objective

The dashboard is designed to provide business stakeholders with an executive view of customer journey performance, campaign effectiveness, conversion behaviour, and revenue generation within the Google Merchandise Store.

The objective is to enable data-driven decision-making by monitoring key business metrics, identifying growth opportunities, and evaluating marketing performance.

---

# Target Audience

- Executive Leadership
- Marketing Managers
- Product Managers
- Business Analysts
- Digital Analytics Team

---

# Dashboard Pages

## Page 1 – Executive Overview

Provides a high-level summary of overall business performance.

KPIs

- Total Revenue
- Total Customer Journeys
- Average Conversion Rate
- Average Revenue per Journey
- Average Touchpoints
- Average Days to Conversion

Visuals

- KPI Cards
- Revenue Trend
- Revenue by Campaign
- Conversion Rate Gauge

---

## Page 2 – Campaign Performance

Analyses marketing campaign effectiveness.

Visuals

- Revenue by Campaign
- Conversion Rate by Campaign
- Campaign Ranking
- Campaign Contribution

---

## Page 3 – Customer Journey Analysis

Analyses customer behaviour before conversion.

Visuals

- Average Touchpoints
- Journey Length
- Days till Conversion
- Customer Journey Distribution

---

## Page 4 – Executive Recommendations

Summarises key findings and business recommendations for decision-makers.
